# Editor-local, all of it. The template's .vscode tasks were removed: they
# implemented a deploy path this project does not use -- decky plugin build,
# which would Docker-build a backend that no longer exists -- and they piped a
# sudo password over ssh, which is not a pattern to ship as though sanctioned.
.vscode/

